store in ONE i_dlm_lock section ~15767-16425 post-edit), then the
opener's ilock ride lands in the ms-long post-store tail {NL, DEMOTING,
RELFLUSH set until ~17834} and the sess47 relflush-admit arm (~28968,
reg files, NO mode check) admits it → prh=1 stamp (.482). sess237
non-repro explained: hold sat AFTER the ride. sess236 restart loop
INSUFFICIENT: every lap re-admitted instantly by the same arm → 5 laps
burn in µs inside the tail → -EIO persists. Fix = epoch-aware wait
(build 2, AFTER measurement proves the arm).

